# Brand colors

Shared brand with harrix-swiss-knife. Tokens live in `src/scss/_variables.scss`.  
Cross-repo table: `.cursor/design-tokens.md` (mirror in HSK `.cursor/design-tokens.md`).

| Token | Hex | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `$h-primary` | `#2e86b7` | Brand / links / solid primary buttons |
| `$h-soft-bg` | `#e8f4fc` | Soft tint (callouts, selection fills) |
| `$h-soft-hover` | `#f3f8fb` | Soft hover |
| `$h-brand-ink` | `#1a5f7a` | Ink on soft fills / primary hover |
| `$h-border` | `#dbdbdb` | Default input / secondary button border |
| `$h-hairline` | `#f0f0f0` | Light separators |
| `$h-separator` | `#e0e0e0` | Row separators |
| `$h-muted-text` | `#5c6370` | Secondary labels |
| `$h-button-secondary-bg` | `#f5f5f5` | Light secondary button fill |
| `$h-success` | `#4caf50` | Success solid |
| `$h-danger` | `#cc584c` | Danger solid |

Bulma injection in `style.scss` keeps `primary` / `link` / `blue` = `#2e86b7`. Semantic accents (`#cc584c`, `#4caf50`, `#eec646`, `#79b1d1`, `#038387`) match HSK Lucide colors — do not change without a reason.

## Buttons

- Primary CTA: solid `$h-primary`, no contrasting accent border (Bulma `.is-primary`).
- Secondary: light fill (`$h-button-secondary-bg`) or `.is-outlined`.

## Rules

- Use `$h-soft-bg` / `$h-soft-hover` / `$h-border` / `$h-muted-text` instead of hardcoding hex or `rgba(46, 134, 183, …)` for soft fills.
- TOC / active reading nav: text color + left border (or underline), **not** app-style fill+border selection.
- Do not port Qt list-selection chrome (rounded selected rows with blue outline) onto the docs site.
- When changing shared tokens: update `_variables.scss`, this rule, `.cursor/design-tokens.md`, and HSK `ui_chrome.py` + `hsk-ui-chrome.mdc`.
